{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I\u2019ve always loved jumping around and blasting rockets in Unreal Tournament \u2014 especially on DM-Morpheus, the one with the three skyscrapers and low gravity. And I\u2019ve got a soft spot for Bomberman on the NES too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So I made a game about a <strong>chihuahua in a spacesuit and rollerskates</strong> who jumps and shoots kinda like in UT, and blows stuff up with bombs kinda like in Bomberman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0In this game, you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">bounce around on gravity trampolines;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">fire a grenade launcher and hop into turret guns;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">drop explosive stuff right on enemies\u2019 heads;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">hunt for secrets \u2014 ammo and golden corn;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">use a shield that blocks lasers (but while it\u2019s on, you can\u2019t shoot or reload);</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and watch enemies get blown to chunky bits.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0This isn\u2019t a game about deep meaning \u2014 it\u2019s a game about <strong>explosions, jumps, impact, and a dog in a spacesuit</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<strong>The demo\u2019s coming soon, so you\u2019ll be able to try it out.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the meantime \u2014 check out the trailers and screenshots, and if it looks fun to you too, I\u2019ll be glad to hear it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you spot any bugs \u2014 let me know, I\u2019ll fix them. I\u2019m making the game solo, so I might\u2019ve missed something, but I tried to make sure everything works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293700/extras/1.gif?t=1744974639\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293700/extras/2.gif?t=1744974639\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3293700?t=1744974639","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293700/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744974639","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293700/0132f11ef45acdd2a8f4552cc4e4aad61eb0fa67/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744974639","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293700/0132f11ef45acdd2a8f4552cc4e4aad61eb0fa67/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744974639","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I\u2019ve always loved jumping around and blasting rockets in Unreal Tournament \u2014 especially on DM-Morpheus, the one with the three skyscrapers and low gravity. And I\u2019ve got a soft spot for Bomberman on the NES too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So I made a game about a <strong>chihuahua in a spacesuit and rollerskates</strong> who jumps and shoots kinda like in UT, and blows stuff up with bombs kinda like in Bomberman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0In this game, you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">bounce around on gravity trampolines;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">fire a grenade launcher and hop into turret guns;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">drop explosive stuff right on enemies\u2019 heads;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">hunt for secrets \u2014 ammo and golden corn;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">use a shield that blocks lasers (but while it\u2019s on, you can\u2019t shoot or reload);</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and watch enemies get blown to chunky bits.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0This isn\u2019t a game about deep meaning \u2014 it\u2019s a game about <strong>explosions, jumps, impact, and a dog in a spacesuit</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<strong>The demo\u2019s coming soon, so you\u2019ll be able to try it out.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the meantime \u2014 check out the trailers and screenshots, and if it looks fun to you too, I\u2019ll be glad to hear it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you spot any bugs \u2014 let me know, I\u2019ll fix them. I\u2019m making the game solo, so I might\u2019ve missed something, but I tried to make sure everything works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293700/extras/1.gif?t=1744974639\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293700/extras/2.gif?t=1744974639\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["TwoDogs"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293700/header.jpg?t=1744974639","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257121531,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121531/movie480.mp4?t=1743633718","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121531/movie_max.mp4?t=1743633718"},"name":"Maya Steps Out - Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257121531/d700aa682a538113c37b7ba57fe49f734c2f2